    <string name="section_lessons">Experience</string>
    <string name="setting_reflect">Review each finished task</string>
    <string name="setting_reflect_hint">After each task the model reviews which steps were wasted and distills lessons (one extra model call). A lesson is used in later tasks once it came up in at least %d tasks or you approve it; lessons whose tasks keep failing drop back to candidates. Lessons stay on the phone and leave out contacts, messages and other personal data.</string>
